    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prehistoric Fury</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roar, breathe fire, shoot firebolts, dodge and roll mid-air, launch special attacks, and make use of loadouts of suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Games, Offline vs Bots, &amp; LAN Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the way you want, set your own rules, with or without internet. Offline play earns you the same rewards as multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Dragon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive character &amp; profile customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fierce Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See where you stack up in the global and regional leaderboard, push yourself to improve and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One-Time Purchase, Yours to Unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions, no online-only content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prehistoric Fury</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roar, breathe fire, shoot firebolts, dodge and roll mid-air, launch special attacks, and make use of loadouts of suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Games, Offline vs Bots, &amp; LAN Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the way you want, set your own rules, with or without internet. Offline play earns you the same rewards as multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Dragon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive character &amp; profile customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fierce Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See where you stack up in the global and regional leaderboard, push yourself to improve and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.poster.avif?t=1750348151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.webm?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.mp4?t=1750348151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One-Time Purchase, Yours to Unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions, no online-only content.</p>",
